Retinol (A vitamini) Piridoksin (Vitamin B

) Askorbik asit (C vitamini) 
Tiamin (Vitamin B

) Biyotin (Vitamin B8) Kolekalsiferol (Vitamin D

) 
Riboflavin (Vitamin B

) Folik asit (Vitamin B

) Alfa-Tokoferol (E Vitamini) 
